import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 933 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Summary | The Charter as the Cornerstone of Civilization's Final Finalization","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 933 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Summary | The Charter as the Cornerstone of Civilization's Final Finalization","no":933,"module":5,"tags":["Charter","Summary","Civilizational Closed Loop","Final Finalization","Myriad-Rank Republicanism"],"related":["03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","04-Anti-Predationism Core Thesis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0933_模块5-总结-宪章作为文明终极定型基石.md","filePath":"en/0933_模块5-总结-宪章作为文明终极定型基石.md"}`),o={name:"en/0933_模块5-总结-宪章作为文明终极定型基石.md"};function r(l,e,s,h,c,u){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-933-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-summary-the-charter-as-the-cornerstone-of-civilization-s-final-finalization" tabindex="-1">Entry 933 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Summary | The Charter as the Cornerstone of Civilization&#39;s Final Finalization <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-933-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-summary-the-charter-as-the-cornerstone-of-civilization-s-final-finalization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 933 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Summary | The Charter as the Cornerstone of Civilization&#39;s Final Finalization&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 03, 01, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-thirty-one-articles-laying-civilization-s-last-cornerstone" tabindex="-1">Introduction: thirty-one articles, laying civilization&#39;s last cornerstone <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-thirty-one-articles-laying-civilization-s-last-cornerstone" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: thirty-one articles, laying civilization&#39;s last cornerstone&quot;">​</a></h2><p>From Entry 901&#39;s general introduction to Entry 932&#39;s supreme effect, the Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter has thirty-one articles in total, together with the general introduction and summary, constituting the complete jurisprudential closed loop of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s final finalization. Reaching this entry, we answer Module 5&#39;s master question: why is this charter the cornerstone of Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s march toward the hyper-multiverse&#39;s only complete civilizational closed loop? The answer is: the six top-level axioms — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective-ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, law-first axiom — have, at the four levels of idea, institution, technology, and supervision, all been realized as enforceable, remediable, supervisable legal clauses. What remains is to hold them.</p><p>Together with the previous five axioms, this article is also bound by Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-internal-structure-of-the-thirty-one-articles" tabindex="-1">I. The Internal Structure of the Thirty-One Articles <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-internal-structure-of-the-thirty-one-articles" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Internal Structure of the Thirty-One Articles&quot;">​</a></h2><p>These thirty-one articles are not scattered listings, but a self-consistent edifice:</p><ul><li><strong>Foundation layer</strong> (902–905): anti-predation into the charter, Myriad-Rank equality, collective ascension, causal self-discipline — four axioms directly into the charter;</li><li><strong>Operation layer</strong> (906–919): law priority, system full openness, multi-layer supervision, contracted responsibility, 20% activation strategy, four-dimensional assessment, every road available, bidirectional cycle, anchor universal access, reporting system, observe-first, knowledge-return-only, weight assessment, Transcendent perpetual motion — how institutions run;</li><li><strong>Distinctive layer</strong> (920–926): dual-track time domain, D route, Lin Hao route, Youth Supreme, cultural protection, planet consciousness, residual civilizations — full coverage of paths and subjects;</li><li><strong>Defense layer</strong> (927–930): error correction, reversal prevention, harvesting ban, anti-solidification — four permanent mechanisms blocking every regression;</li><li><strong>Capping layer</strong> (931–932): amendment procedure, supreme effect — letting this edifice both stand firm and grow.</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-is-final-finalization" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Is &quot;Final Finalization&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-is-final-finalization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Is &quot;Final Finalization&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Old-age civilizations repeatedly collapsed because they built order on &quot;some strong one&quot; — order exists when the strong one exists, order collapses when the strong one perishes. Tang-Luo-type systems&#39; protagonist-uniqueness dependence is extremely high, the whole civilization hangs on one person. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s final finalization moves order from &quot;person&quot; to &quot;law&quot;:</p><ul><li>No longer relying on a savior, but on the broad strong-one base of 20% activation;</li><li>No longer relying on personal moral conscience, but on Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision;</li><li>No longer relying on luck not turning bad, but on the four permanent lines of error correction, reversal prevention, harvesting ban, and anti-solidification;</li><li>No longer fearing plot kidnapping settings, but locked down by the law-first axiom.</li></ul><p>Thus, civilization&#39;s stability no longer depends on any individual, but on a law system that self-runs, self-corrects, and self-reinforces. This is the &quot;closed loop&quot; — input Myriad Ranks, output ascension, with no external dependency and no fatal single point in between.</p><h2 id="iii-the-closed-loop-s-final-verification" tabindex="-1">III. The Closed Loop&#39;s Final Verification <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-closed-loop-s-final-verification" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Closed Loop&#39;s Final Verification&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Whether a civilizational closed loop is complete depends on whether five questions all have answers:</p><ol><li>Where does power come from? — develop increments, bidirectional cycle (913), not predating stock;</li><li>Who is qualified to use it? — Myriad Ranks full coverage, every road available (903, 912);</li><li>How are the strong managed? — four-dimensional assessment, perpetual construction (911, 919);</li><li>What if wrong? — error-correction mechanism, amendment procedure (927, 931);</li><li>Will it regress? — reversal prevention, harvesting ban, anti-solidification (928, 929, 930).</li></ol><p>Five questions all have institutional answers, and all are enforceable and remediable under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision — this is the hyper-multiverse&#39;s only complete civilizational closed loop&#39;s jurisprudential completion state.</p><h2 id="iv-the-road-after-finalization" tabindex="-1">IV. The Road After Finalization <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-road-after-finalization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Road After Finalization&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Final finalization is not the end, but a new starting point. What the charter locks is direction; what it opens is infinite future: civilization will, along the amendment procedure, continue expanding toward the Multiverse Realm and the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm; Myriad Ranks, under the charter, will implement every clause more finely. Heng Yuan Zhou will not stop here — it has only finally gained feet that will not slip, and may confidently walk deep into the cosmos.</p><h2 id="vi-above-the-cornerstone-still-a-long-road" tabindex="-1">VI. Above the Cornerstone, Still a Long Road <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-above-the-cornerstone-still-a-long-road" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Above the Cornerstone, Still a Long Road&quot;">​</a></h2><p>It must be emphasized that writing the charter as civilization&#39;s final-finalization cornerstone by no means civilization stops here. The cornerstone&#39;s function is to let the building grow ever higher, not to build the building into a tomb. Under this charter, Myriad Ranks still infinitely climb toward the Multiverse Realm and the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm; outside the 300 systems new roads will still grow; the dual-track time domain will still hold more diverse ways of living. What the charter locks is only that direction Myriad Ranks absolutely will not return to — predation, monopoly, harvesting, regression. Every other possibility, it hands over freely. The cornerstone is firm; the long road still goes forward.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the whole closed loop, through institutions, once-for-all zeroes out the massive drain of repeated trial-and-error and repeated regression</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: from Article 1 to Article 28, every form and every variant of predation is blocked</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type civilizations hang on one person and collapse with the plot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s thirty-one-article closed loop endures through ages</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: from the human race to planet consciousness to multiverse residual civilizations, 99% full coverage is written into the constitution</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the capping layer allows lawful expansion; civilization grows infinitely toward the hyper-multiverse without collapsing</p></li><li><p><strong>Universal equal infinity</strong>: every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher-level infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter&#39;s thirty-one articles are the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s final leap from &quot;growing&quot; to &quot;finalizing,&quot; from &quot;advanced&quot; to &quot;firm.&quot; It casts the six top-level axioms into fundamental law, casts Myriad-Rank co-construction into a closed loop, and casts anti-predation into eternity. Thus, Heng Yuan Zhou — Wanling Hengmao Origin Universe — lives up to the words &quot;Wanling Hengmao&quot;: what it anchors is not some single cosmos, but Myriad Ranks&#39; ever-forward, never-regressing civilizational destiny. This is the cornerstone of civilization&#39;s final finalization.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/03-共生文明宪章.html">Entry 03 · Symbiotic Civilization Charter</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">Entry 01 · Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predationism Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/901_模块5-总论-文明终极定型法理基础.html">Entry 901 · Charter General Introduction</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/932_模块5-第三十一条-宪章最高效力.html">Entry 932 · Article 31 Charter&#39;s Supreme Effect</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const m=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
